# Ikemen_GO-Elecbyte-Screenpack
ScreenpackLicense.txt
# Upstream keeps the runtime assets in the Ikemen-GO-Screenpack repository and
# excludes them here. This fork commits them instead: they are CC BY 3.0 and
# CC BY-NC 3.0, and a self-contained clone that builds and runs is worth more
# to this project than a small repository. See LICENCE.txt for attribution.
#
# Characters remain excluded. jubei and jubei2 are generated from Samurai
# Shodown artwork, which is not ours to redistribute; run setup.sh --chars.
